# Incode

> Incode (Incode Snc) is an Italian creative studio founded in 2007 and based in
> Mantova, Italy, specialising in full-stack web development, e-commerce, custom
> software and UX/UI design. Tagline: "You think. We build." Incode works with
> its clients rather than just for them.

## Services

- **Websites & E-commerce**: WordPress, WooCommerce, Drupal, Shopify
- **Custom projects**: Ruby on Rails, Node.js, Vue.js, architecture and integration
- **UX / UI**: design, evaluation, assessment and consulting

